@CustomerReviewInsights_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056

### Get all reviews
GET {{CustomerReviewInsights_HostAddress}}/api/reviews
Accept: application/json

###

### Get review by id
GET {{CustomerReviewInsights_HostAddress}}/api/reviews/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a review
POST {{CustomerReviewInsights_HostAddress}}/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewText": "The application crashes whenever I open order history."
}
